  "releaseNotes": "Resolve markdown references instead of handing the text back\nMove markdown rendering to the clients that show it\nLet a member fill in their social profiles\nAnswer a rejected registration with a reason, not with a server error\nLet a signed-in visitor file the enquiry on their own account\nTake the broker enquiry from a form that could not be sent to one that is answered\nUpdated Ecng.IO.Compression to 1.0.46.\nUpdated Ecng.Linq to 1.0.182.\nUpdated Ecng.Net.Clients to 1.0.366.",
